    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maw can't see you or hear you. Be careful the Maw hungers, it devours. The Ear listens, it hears for the Maw. The Peeper seeks, it sees for the Maw. Can you escape the Maw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my very first indie game :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple short survival horror game. Beat the game to unlock a level select menu and bonus content.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Maw can't see you or hear you. Be careful the Maw hungers, it devours. The Ear listens, it hears for the Maw. The Peeper seeks, it sees for the Maw. Can you escape the Maw?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my very first indie game :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple short survival horror game. Beat the game to unlock a level select menu and bonus content.</p>",
    "short_description": "A stealth action survival horror game. Avoid the Maw, a blind and deaf monster, to avoid being devoured. Despite being unable to see or hear you the Maw can be directed to you location by other monsters who can. Explore the rooms and collect the keys to escape.",
